## Research notes

- Accessible metadata (not benchmark scores): OpenRouter lists `openai/gpt-5.2-pro` with provider routing/pricing (e.g. $21/$168 per 1M tokens in fetched snapshot) and supported request parameters. Artificial Analysis page for this exact model/ID was not accessible in fetched results.
- OpenAI's "Introducing GPT-5.2" announcement reports benchmark results for GPT-5.2 family variants (e.g. GPT-5.2 Thinking) across evaluations such as GDPval, SWE-Bench Pro, GPQA Diamond, and others; however, verifiable benchmark numbers explicitly and separately attributable to the exact `GPT-5.2 Pro` model/ID were not clearly extractable from accessible sources reviewed here.
- No standalone verified benchmark scores clearly attributable to the exact model/ID `gpt-5.2-pro` were found in accessible sources; to avoid conflating Pro with other GPT-5.2 variants, no scored report is produced.
- Per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md`: if zero verified public benchmark numbers are found for the exact model/ID, save a notes-only `.md.excluded` file and do not invent placeholder scores.

